-    # THE WINDOW IS NOT THE LEVER, WHICH THAT 80-192 s SPREAD IS THE PROOF OF: it straddles the
-    # 120 s the job waits, so the same healthy deployment reds or greens on how fast Vercel felt
-    # that minute. Raising the number buys silence and leaves the alarm timing an event that has
